SUMMARY:Faculty Concert Series: Gilles Vonsattel Plays Beethoven's Piano So
 natas
LOCATION:UMass Amherst\, 151 Presidents Drive\, Amherst\, MA 01003
DESCRIPTION:Bezanson Recital Hall\nUMass Professor of Piano Gilles Vonsatte
 l is in the midst of a multi-year journey through one of the most challeng
 ing and important catalogs in the classical music canon\, traveling from c
 oast to coast\, performing all 32 of Beethoven’s piano sonatas in a seri
 es of concerts at prestigious venues in New York and California.\nhttps://
 events.umass.edu/event/faculty-concert-series-gilles-vonsattel-plays-beeth
 ovens-piano-sonatas\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/weste
 rnma/
URL:https://events.umass.edu/event/faculty-concert-series-gilles-vonsattel-
 plays-beethovens-piano-sonatas
